[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20466.83, "timestamp": "05:41:06", "text": "啊，是的，他們笑了，你以後再也不這樣做了，說他們很抱歉，他們做得太過分了，所以我的孩子在哪裡？喔不，喔不，孩子在睡覺，呃，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20475.31, "timestamp": "05:41:15", "text": "人群中，一個叫瑪蒂達的人，她叫什麼名字？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20491.07, "timestamp": "05:41:31", "text": "瑪蒂爾達站了出來，好的[音樂] 哦，現在別擔心，他安全回家了，回家了。但是孩子不在那裡，想像有人綁架了孩子，什麼什麼什麼，上帝，這太黑暗了，對不起，對不起，我的大腦一片空白，它在想別的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20497.468, "timestamp": "05:41:37", "text": "好吧，她殺了她自己的一隻雞，我們去拿假血，哦不，哦不，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20503.423, "timestamp": "05:41:43", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so joq what you gonna do for April fools"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20514.836, "timestamp": "05:41:54", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "eh, dazai wasnt a member?"}]